  unitName: Hellborn Dilias
  unitId: 60105
  unitNumber: 375
  description: The Death God Lodaga and the Soul Keeper Lemia fought for a long time.
    Then one day before Lemia's very eyes Lodaga transformed. Taking attack after
    wicked attack from this sinister form, she felt somehow nostalgic. Realizing
    why she felt this way, she was filled with fear. Dilias had searched her out
    in order to consume her and complete his evolution.
  summonDesc: I am Dilias, ruler of the dead.<br>I am filled with a great emptiness<br>which
    I don't know how to fill.<br>
  fusionDesc: Power...more power!<br>Dedicate your soul to me<br>and fill this void
    within me!
  evoDesc: Bwa ha ha...ha ha ha!<br>Why!? Why is my heart filled<br>with such emptiness?
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
